BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:El Tour de Tucson
DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20261121
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20261122
DTSTAMP:20261017T141507Z
UID:ed0c9e0018dfd1cca567a5ae@visitarizona-calendar
DESCRIPTION:One of the premier bicycling events in the country. More than 
 9\,500 cyclists from around the world meet with fellow cyclists and intera
 ct with exhibitors at the El Tour Expo & Fiesta. Interact with exhibitors 
 from national bicycle manufacturers to local businesses showcasing the lat
 est bicycles\, accessories and apparel.Merchandise sales\, product demos\,
  giveaways\, panels\, contests\, music and entertainment\, local food vend
 ors and food trucks\, the Dragoon beer garden. The races include the Centu
 ry/102 miles\, the Metric Century/62-mile\, the Metric Half Century/32 mil
 es\, fun rides/3 miles\, and 5K run/walk.\n\nEvent website: https://eltour
 detucson.org/\n\nVisit Arizona listing: https://www.visitarizona.com/event
 s/el-tour-de-tucson
LAST-MODIFIED:20261017T141507Z
URL:https://www.visitarizona.com/events/el-tour-de-tucson
END:VEVENT
